<title>INDIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>INDIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970411)</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> * 12 Apr 97 - Prime Minister Deve Gowda said he had tendered*</p>
<p> *		 his resignation to President Sharma and been  *</p>
<p> *		 asked to remain as caretaker prime minister   *</p>
<p> *		 until alternative arrangements are made.	*</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
<p> President (Sworn in 25 Jul 92)...........Shankar Dayal SHARMA</p>
<p> Vice President.......................Kocheril Raman NARAYANAN</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>UNITED FRONT (UF) COALITION GOVERNMENT (Formed 1 June 96):</p>
